          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>The right fit makes all the difference when it comes to contact lenses. Lenses that don’t fit properly can lead to discomfort, irritation, or blurry vision. That’s why our eye doctors in Pine Beach take the time to get it right. Our goal is to make sure your lenses feel natural, so you don’t have to think about them once they’re in.</p>",
