          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Here’s what you can expect when you come to Academy Vision:</p><ul><li>We check your vision and overall eye health</li><li>We take measurements to ensure the best possible fit</li><li>We evaluate your tear film to make sure your eyes stay comfortable</li><li>We fit you with trial lenses so you can experience how they feel</li><li>We make adjustments based on comfort and clarity</li></ul>",
          "id": "rtA2iAOexx",
